Change(genesis='66602cd0dec37d58d03eec9518ca805a7ac38ea912d2b0c366a0b67b4b9f50b6', deps=(), event=Decided(decision='connections', at=datetime(2026, 10, 9, 0, 0, 0), actor='assistant', title='A connection is a template applied and read back out of the instance; adding or granting one is a tapped card', body="*A connection is a template applied, read back out of the instance* (2026-10-09, stage 4; `suzatary_core::connect`, `secretary::connections`): a template is data, a connection's tables, steps and check are functions of it, and adding, removing or granting one is a tapped card whose edit is byte-preserving and refused unless its text reads back as the algebra's tables. A link served from an origin its plugin may not reach is stored nowhere and asked for as a Grant naming only the origin. Its `Group` and `Standing` are the overview's (one of each), a standing the join of its steps', and a terminal's step is a `Run` spelled by the one `connect::Reach` init spells by.", rationale='Decided 2026-10-09 (setup agent stage 4).', supersedes=()))